{"data":{"attachmentkeynames":["rs"],"desc":"One repo's share of the agent-committer sweep (agent.committer.sweep loops the registry over it; callable by hand on any repo in the dev.git registry - it does not consult commit-repos.json). Never commits on master/main (branches-always) and yields to dev.git autocommit (shadowed - never two drivers). Takes dev.git.store_status's complete report and commits every group: store units (lib.ctl), library-level groups (lib: metadata, assets, publish metadata, records the store no longer knows), and the non-store rest grouped by top-level directory (files:<top>). ONE composed message per group (compose_message, LLM + fallback), committed with dev.git.commit_paths over exactly the reported paths - deletions included - so the repo ends clean and an immediate second sweep makes zero LLM calls. A group whose commit fails is remembered in memory by its path set: while unchanged, later sweeps retry the commit with the mechanical message and no LLM call. When the running core predates commit_paths (static newbound_core not yet restarted) it answers core_not_activated and does nothing. Pushes once, only when the branch tracks an upstream with unpushed work (an unpublished branch is reported, never published). Returns FLAT {repo, branch, result (clean|ok|commit_failed|refused_default_branch|shadowed_by_dev_autocommit|core_not_activated|...), groups, commits, llm_calls, committed:[{unit, msg_source, paths}], commit_errs, pushed, push|push_err}.","import":"use flowlang::datastore::DataStore;\nuse ndata::dataobject::DataObject;\nuse ndata::dataarray::DataArray;\nuse ndata::data::Data;\nuse crate::agent::committer::compose_message::compose_message;","params":[{"name":"repo","type":"String"}],"returntype":"FLAT","type":"rust"},"id":"jhktss1a1c65be826v3","readers":[],"time":1794329358631,"username":"system","writers":[]}